  "plain": "Jesse Michels says he has seen the DD214, the US military's discharge record, of a former Air Force man named Bob Jacobs. He says it shows Jacobs \"definitely worked at Vandenberg,\" the California air base where Jacobs places a 1964 Atlas rocket launch that he says was scrubbed from the records. Michels tells this himself, to back up Jacobs against a Wall Street Journal report he criticises."
